      }
    ],
    "status": "present",
    "value": "The constructor receives the contents of read-only streams; the solution wraps each in a Stream object exposing only read(k) (returns up to k remaining characters, \"\" when empty) and never inspects stream contents directly. read(n) returns the next n characters of the concatenation of all streams in order, or fewer if all streams are exhausted, buffering any characters read from a Stream but not yet returned (read4 II style)."
  },
